# Real captured skins. testdata/ holds skins logged through the proxy,
# including the maintainer's own skin textures and identity-embedded folder
# names (testdata/captures/THE_BOSS9345-...). Committing them leaks real
# player data and violates the project's "no real skins in the repo" rule, so
# the whole directory stays local. The detection tests still reference it; a
# maintainer must place the real captures there themselves.
testdata/

